# Project Overview

## Project Name
Threat Intelligence Automation Pipeline

## Team
[Your Name]

## Purpose
This project uses LLM chains and RAG workflows to analyze cybersecurity alerts, classify threats, and recommend incident response actions.

---

# Architecture

## Components
- Flowise AI
- n8n workflow automation
- Groq LLM
- HuggingFace Embeddings
- In-Memory Vector Store

## Workflow
1. Alert classification
2. Threat analysis
3. Response recommendation
4. Automated workflow chaining in n8n

---

# Coding Standards

## Naming
- Use descriptive variable names
- Use lowercase_with_underscores for workflow fields

## Security
- Never hardcode API keys
- Use environment variables where possible

---

# AI Assistant Behavior

When generating code:
- Prioritize readability
- Include comments
- Validate JSON formatting
- Follow cybersecurity best practices

